  "prerequisites": ["while 迴圈", "質數概念", "整數除法"],
  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>將一個正整數分解成質因數的乘積。</p><p>給定一個整數 <code>a</code>（<code>a ≥ 2</code>），請找出所有質因數（可重複），由小到大輸出。例如 <code>12 = 2 × 2 × 3</code>，應輸出 <code>2 2 3</code>；若 <code>a</code> 本身就是質數（例如 13），則只輸出它自己。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>從最小的因數 2 開始，只要能整除就不斷除盡並記錄，再嘗試下一個因數；最後若剩下的數大於 1，它本身也是一個質因數。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>一行，包含一個整數 <code>a</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>一行，輸出 <code>a</code> 的所有質因數（由小到大，可重複），以空格分隔。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>2 ≤ a ≤ 10000</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "12",
  "sampleOutput": "2 2 3",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "12", "output": "2 2 3" },
    { "input": "30", "output": "2 3 5" },
    { "input": "13", "output": "13" }
  ],
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "2", "output": "2" },
    { "input": "3", "output": "3" },
    { "input": "9", "output": "3 3" },
    { "input": "12", "output": "2 2 3" },
    { "input": "13", "output": "13" },
    { "input": "30", "output": "2 3 5" },
    { "input": "97", "output": "97" },
    { "input": "100", "output": "2 2 5 5" },
    { "input": "1024", "output": "2 2 2 2 2 2 2 2 2 2" },
    { "input": "10000", "output": "2 2 2 2 5 5 5 5" }
  ],
